Subject: [freebsd-ports PATCH 1/2] net-mgmt/signoz-otel-collector: SigNoz
 OpenTelemetry Collector
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:22:27 +0000

The SigNoz OpenTelemetry Collector receives logs, metrics, and traces
over OTLP, Jaeger, and HTTP, and writes them to ClickHouse for SigNoz,
an open source observability platform. It adds SigNoz's exporters and
processors to the OpenTelemetry Collector, such as span metrics and
log pipelines that SigNoz manages over OpAMP.

It also creates and migrates the SigNoz schema in ClickHouse. SigNoz
reads that schema, so this collector is needed for SigNoz to work, but
it may run on another host.

WWW: https://github.com/SigNoz/signoz-otel-collector
